{"hymn":"S121","parent":"E148","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Rey de reyes eres Tú","subtitle":"Alabanza al Señor—Su reino","syl":{"n1":"Rey","n2":"de","n3":["re","i"],"n5":["yes","t"],"n6":["e","i"],"n7":["res","t"],"n8":"Tú,","n9":"Nos","n10":["pos","i"],"n11":["tra","m"],"n13":["mos","t"],"n14":"en","n15":"Tu","n16":"luz;","n18":"Oh","n19":["Un","i"],"n20":["gi","m"],"n22":["do","t"],"n23":["ce","i"],"n24":["les","m"],"n25":["tial,","t"],"n26":["Te‿a","i"],"n27":["do","m"],"n28":["ra","m"],"n30":["mos","t"],"n31":"sin","n32":["ce","i"],"n33":["sar;","t"],"n34":"De","n35":"los","n36":["re","i"],"n38":["yes","t"],"n39":["e","i"],"n40":["res","t"],"n41":"Rey,","n42":["Te‿en","i"],"n43":["sal","m"],"n44":["za","m"],"n46":["mos","t"],"n47":"en","n48":"Tu","n49":"grey."},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Tu poder y autoridad","Por la tierra se verán;","Todos te adorarán,","Frente al trono servirán;","Rey de reyes, en Tu honor,","Ofrecemos hoy loor."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Es Tu reino celestial,","Y Tu trono eternal;","A Tu gloria y poder","Cantaremos por doquier;","Mas ahora, nuestro Rey,","Te alabamos en la grey."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Nuestro soberano Rey,","Tu nombre precioso es;","Disfrutamos Tu reinar,","¡Venga el reino en total!","Rey de reyes, hoy aquí","Toda honra‿es para Ti."]}]}